:::{subfigure #fig:sens-c caption="Rainfall"}
![](panel.png)
:::

::::

Panel @fig:sens-b carries no caption of its own, and the prose refers to
it by its letter, exactly as the source thesis does.

| Parameter | Yield |
|:----------|------:|
| Water     |   1.4 |
| Nitrogen  |   0.8 |
: Measured yield per parameter {#tbl:yield}

@tbl:yield lists what was measured.

:::{listing #lst:dine caption="The fitting driver"}
```clojure
(defn fit [model data]
  (bisect (partial residual model) data))
```
:::

:::{algorithm #alg:bisect caption="Bisection"}
```
KwData: an interval [a, b], a tolerance t
While (b - a) > t {
  m <- (a + b) / 2
  If f(a) * f(m) < 0 { b <- m } Else { a <- m }
}
```
:::

